  "details": "Hello. Horizon Adjust is a godsend for everyone who wants to lay down and relax in VRC.\nBut one annoying problem is that it doesn't let you lock adjustment for horizonal and vertical horizon movement, thus the adjusted horizon is always slightly turned horizontally than it should.\nThe 90 degree snapping tool doesn't help as its too restrictive and I'm not able to make it work well with any adjustment (adjusts way too high for me with it on).\nI think locking the horizonal and vertical axis for horizon adjust would do wonders for fixing this issue and hopefully it will be added sooner rather than later.\nThanks~!",
